<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-029" chapter-id="c-liangshu-029-appraisal" source-id="s-liangshu-029-appraisal-ws1538079">
  <p id="c-liangshu-029-appraisal:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">史臣曰：自周、漢廣樹籓屏，固本深根；<persName id="c-liangshu-029-appraisal:p001:m0018" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf">高祖</persName>之封建，將遵古制也。<persName id="c-liangshu-029-appraisal:p001:m0030" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_C">南康</persName>、<persName id="c-liangshu-029-appraisal:p001:m0033" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_G">廬陵</persName>並以宗室之貴，據磐石之重，<persName id="c-liangshu-029-appraisal:p001:m0048" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_C">績</persName>以孝著，<persName id="c-liangshu-029-appraisal:p001:m0053" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_G">續</persName>以勇聞。<persName id="c-liangshu-029-appraisal:p001:m0058" ref="81y_7i5_frc">綸</persName>聰警有才學，性險躁，屢以罪黜，及太清之亂，忠孝獨存，斯可嘉矣。</p>
</text>
